        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-QUADTREE-DAI-FOLDING.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-QUADTREE-DAI-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH231-GRADIENT-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH232-DAI-FILL-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH233-DAT-BIN-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH234-FRICTIONLESS-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH235-PARITY-CLOSURE-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-QUADTREE-DAI-WITNESS     PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-QUADTREE-DAI.
            GOBACK.
        1000-EVALUATE-QUADTREE-DAI.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-TH231-GRADIENT-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH232-DAI-FILL-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH233-DAT-BIN-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH234-FRICTIONLESS-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH235-PARITY-CLOSURE-OK = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-QUADTREE-DAI-WITNESS
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-QUADTREE-DAI-WITNESS.
